{"id":"eb8e9519813ba70b","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-elementary-system-definition.md","title":"Elementary System Definition","display":"df-elementary-system-definition — Elementary System Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-elementary-system-definition","aliases":["90-df-elementary-system-definition"],"display":"df-elementary-system-definition — Elementary System Definition","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-elementary-system-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-elementary-system-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-system-definition — Elementary System Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>给定列举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{a_0,\\ldots,a_{\\ell-1}\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{a_0,\\ldots,a_{\\ell-1}\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，两者各自无重复且不相交；谓词符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_j\">\\(P_j\\)</span> 互异并与二者不交，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r_j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>每个规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\vec A,B)\\in\\mathcal R\">\\((\\vec A,B)\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span> 由有限原子模式列和一个原子模式组成；模式中没有除所列词变量之外的未声明符号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (finite alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> (countably infinite set of word variables, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\">\\(V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\{(P_j,r_j):j&lt;m\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P=\\{(P_j,r_j):j&lt;m\\}\\)</span> (finite family of predicate symbols with arities)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V}\\)</span> (word schemes)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}\\)</span> (atomic schemes)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> (finite family of schematic rules)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> (elementary-system presentation, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}system\\text{-}definition}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma\\cup V)^*,\\\\\n\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{P_j(t_0,\\ldots,t_{r_j-1}):\nj&lt;m,\\ t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R&amp;\\subseteq\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}\\bigr)^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\times\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P},\\\\\n\\mathcal E&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal R),\\\\\n0&lt;|\\Sigma|&amp;&lt;\\infty,\\qquad\n|\\mathcal P|&lt;\\infty,\\qquad |\\mathcal R|&lt;\\infty,\n\\qquad |V|=\\aleph_0,\\quad V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}system\\text{-}definition}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma\\cup V)^*,\\\\\n\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{P_j(t_0,\\ldots,t_{r_j-1}):\nj&lt;m,\\ t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R&amp;\\subseteq\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}\\bigr)^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\times\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P},\\\\\n\\mathcal E&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal R),\\\\\n0&lt;|\\Sigma|&amp;&lt;\\infty,\\qquad\n|\\mathcal P|&lt;\\infty,\\qquad |\\mathcal R|&lt;\\infty,\n\\qquad |V|=\\aleph_0,\\quad V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 中的具体字符串充当代入后的项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Sigma\\cup V)^*\">\\((\\Sigma\\cup V)^*\\)</span> 中的字模式用于写有限规则图式。规则明确是“有限前提列—结论”对。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> 的规则实例生成系统的断言闭包；“何时属于初等系统”由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b263fc62b64e4bb\" href=\"?note=5b263fc62b64e4bb\" title=\"90-df-elementary-system\">90-df-elementary-system</a> 判定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"5b263fc62b64e4bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal R$ 的规则实例生成系统的断言闭包；“何时属于初等系统”由 [[90-df-elementary-system]] 判定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{a_0,\\ldots,a_{\\ell-1}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P_j","display":false},{"tex":"r_j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(\\vec A,B)\\in\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P=\\{(P_j,r_j):j<m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}system\\text{-}definition}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V}&\\coloneqq(\\Sigma\\cup V)^*,\\\\\n\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}\n&\\coloneqq\n\\{P_j(t_0,\\ldots,t_{r_j-1}):\nj<m,\\ t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R&\\subseteq\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}\\bigr)^{<\\omega}\n\\times\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P},\\\\\n\\mathcal E&\\coloneqq(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal R),\\\\\n0<|\\Sigma|&<\\infty,\\qquad\n|\\mathcal P|<\\infty,\\qquad |\\mathcal R|<\\infty,\n\\qquad |V|=\\aleph_0,\\quad V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Sigma\\cup V)^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R","display":false}],"bytes":2043,"backlinks":[{"id":"5b263fc62b64e4bb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E=(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal R)$ 取 [[90-df-elementary-system-definition]]，其中 $\\Sigma=\\{a_i:i<\\ell\\}$、$V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}$ 分别无重复，$\\mathcal P=\\{(P_j,r_j):j<m\\}$；$\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V},\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}$ 使用同一词模式语法。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-elementary-system-definition]]、[[90-df-elementary-system]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90